  "details": "1. Create a button that takes ownership of an array of gameobjects\n\n2. Populate the array with 500 objects that have udonsharp scripts on them. UdonSharp scripts syncing method doesn't matter and it doesn't need to have any synced variables.\n\n3. Load 2 clients into the world and take turns pressing the button until someone gets kicked from the world.",
